  <activityDataset>
    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="72be818c-a860-56cd-9c7d-c983c4ee93a8" activityNameId="688177a9-f17f-54cc-9f8d-c11bdd7c80e4" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">SOFC fuel cell 125kWe, future</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: SOFC fuel cell 125kWe, future
The module reflects a solid oxide fuel cell (SOFC) system with 125 kW electrical output. Inventory based on information from literature and one manufacturer. Life time operation of auxiliary systems is 80'000 h. Stack lifetime is 48'000 h.;
Synonyms: solid oxide fuel cell, oxidkeramische Hochtemperaturbrennstoffzelle, Festoxid Brennstoffzelle, Festkeramik Brennstoffzelle; 
UUID: e00fdfe1-df9f-34c2-b6a1-4b27259faade
The module includes the most important materials used for production, the energy needed for production, planning and engineering. Also included is the transport of the raw materials, the engine delivery and the installation on site.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Solid oxide fuel cell (SOFC) with unpressurised tubular stack design for central cogeneration use. Performance, stack lifetime and catalyst use according to expected future values for a serial product. Operation with connection to low pressure gas network. Electrical efficiency 47%, total efficiency 80%.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature data and manufacturer information 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_e00fdfe1-df9f-34c2-b6a1-4b27259faade.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
